  (text "⑪ 主控 HC32F005C6PA（TSSOP-20）★片上主控" (at 10 379.79999999999995 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000014"))
  (text "引脚分配（AF 号取自官方参考手册 Rev2.50 的 Pxx_SEL 位定义，非推断）：" (at 14 390.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015"))
  (text "  6路PWM：P23=TIM4_CHA(A高) P15=TIM4_CHB(A低) │ P25=TIM5_CHA(B高) P26=TIM5_CHB(B低) │ P36=TIM6_CHA(C高,SEL2) P32=TIM6_CHB(C低)" (at 14 394.79999999999995 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000016"))
  (text "  5路模拟：P24=AIN0(A相电压) P33=AIN3(B相电压) P02=AIN8(C相电压) P35=AIN5(母线电流) P01=AIN7(母线电压)" (at 14 399.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000017"))
  (text "  其它：P14=UART0_TXD  P27/P31=SWDIO/SWCLK  P00=RESETB  P03/P34=空闲(no-connect)  VCAP(脚8)=4.7µF" (at 14 403.59999999999997 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000018"))
  (text "★调试焊盘（TP1–TP19，SMT 测试点 C5846954）——需引出焊盘的引脚全在这里，MCU 已用 IO 一个不漏：" (at 14 408 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000019"))
  (text "  TP1=3V3  TP2=GND  TP3=SWDIO(P27/脚17)  TP4=SWCLK(P31/脚18)  TP5=RESETB(P00/脚4)  TP6=UART_TX(P14/脚12)" (at 14 412.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000001a"))
  (text "  TP7=A相电压(P24/脚14)  TP8=B相电压(P33/脚20)  TP9=C相电压(P02/脚6)  TP10=母线电流(P35/脚2)  TP11=母线电压(P01/脚5)" (at 14 416.79999999999995 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000001b"))
  (text "  TP12..TP17=六路PWM：AH(P23/脚13) AL(P15/脚11) BH(P25/脚15) BL(P26/脚16) CH(P36/脚3) CL(P32/脚19)  TP18=VCC12V  TP19=PGND" (at 14 421.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000001c"))
  (text "  R50=复位上拉  R53=12V→LDO_VIN桥接  R52=LDO→VDD_3V3桥接" (at 14 425.59999999999997 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000001d"))
  (text "⚠️ P27/P31 支持 SWD 或 UART ISP；P35/P36 部分被 ADC/PWM 占用，优先使用 P27/P31。⚠️ 无 VC 硬件刹车 → 软件限流 + FD6288T 自带 SCP。" (at 14 430 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000001e"))
